<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lawter Int'l started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lawter Int'l started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Lawter International Inc as a hold.</p>
<p>-- said new management is poised to revitalize Lawter by making acquisitions and taking advantage of its &quot;underleveraged&quot; balance sheet.</p>
<p>-- expects Lawter to earn $0.70 a share in 1997 and $0.80 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Lawter lost 1/8 to 11-5/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
